# Web (`web-app`)

Feature-based React + TypeScript (Vite).

```
web-app/src/
  features/<feature>/
  components/
  hooks/
  services/   # centralized REST client
  stores/     # Zustand — client/UI state only
  theme/
```

- Talk to `/api/v1` only via `services/`
- Zustand for session/UI — not every API response
- Frontend Zod = UX only; backend is authority
- Roles: `SUPER` | `ADMIN` | `TUTOR` | `STUDENT`
